WEBVTT

00:17.990 --> 00:22.250
<b><i>The tool I cast away became Gilbert's dog.</i></b>

00:22.960 --> 00:29.000
<b><i>But even after losing her arms,
her master, and everything she'd ever had,</i></b>

00:30.380 --> 00:34.510
<b><i>she still stood tall.</i></b>

01:22.100 --> 01:23.430
<b>Thank you.</b>

01:33.610 --> 01:34.740
<b>All too naïve.</b>

01:36.030 --> 01:37.780
<b>Time's up.</b>

01:38.110 --> 01:41.830
<b>If you'd killed me right at the outset,
you might have made it.</b>

01:43.450 --> 01:44.870
<b>Bombs?</b>

01:50.880 --> 01:52.460
<b>Stop the train!</b>

01:52.460 --> 01:53.460
<b>Now!</b>

01:56.260 --> 01:57.050
<b>It won't work!</b>

01:57.590 --> 01:58.930
<b>Use the brakes in the carriage!</b>

01:59.300 --> 02:00.510
<b>Emergency brakes!</b>

02:12.940 --> 02:13.520
<b>What the...</b>

02:25.870 --> 02:26.660
<b>Violet!</b>

02:38.260 --> 02:39.800
<b>Violet!</b>

02:39.800 --> 02:41.470
<b>Get the other bomb!</b>

02:41.720 --> 02:42.470
<b>Got it!</b>

02:50.810 --> 02:51.770
<b>It's off!</b>

02:57.740 --> 02:58.280
<b>Violet!</b>

04:05.890 --> 04:06.930
<b>Violet!</b>

04:12.810 --> 04:15.060
Holmgard,
Capital of Gardariki

04:12.810 --> 04:15.060
Holmgard,
Capital of Gardariki

04:12.810 --> 04:15.060
Holmgard,
Capital of Gardariki

04:15.060 --> 04:17.820
Temporary
Leidenschaftlich Embassy

04:15.060 --> 04:17.820
Temporary
Leidenschaftlich Embassy

04:15.060 --> 04:17.820
Temporary
Leidenschaftlich Embassy

04:16.650 --> 04:23.240
<b>"The nations of Gardariki and Leidenschaftlich will strive to maintain international peace and order</b>

04:23.240 --> 04:27.330
<b>and hereby sign an all-encompassing pact that respects each other's sovereignty.</b>

04:29.040 --> 04:33.210
<b>To that end, both nations will immediately recommence free and fair trade,</b>

04:33.210 --> 04:36.380
<b>and Leidenschaftlich will, as a token of friendship,</b>

04:36.380 --> 04:39.590
<b>provide one year's worth of emergency aid.</b>

04:41.380 --> 04:45.760
<b>Both nations hereby swear to adhere to and uphold this treaty to the utmost."</b>

04:49.390 --> 04:50.470
<b>It's over.</b>

04:51.020 --> 04:51.770
<b>Yeah.</b>

04:54.310 --> 04:55.390
<b>What's wrong?</b>

04:57.860 --> 04:59.070
<b>It's over, and yet...</b>

05:01.360 --> 05:02.570
<b>It's over...</b>

05:03.190 --> 05:05.200
<b>The War is over,</b>

05:05.820 --> 05:07.950
<b>and yet our son still hasn't come home.</b>

05:08.570 --> 05:12.950
<b>I keep telling my wife that we should give up on him.</b>

05:14.790 --> 05:15.580
<b>But...</b>

05:16.960 --> 05:17.790
<b>I understand.</b>

05:19.920 --> 05:22.630
<b>I understand how you feel very well.</b>

05:26.930 --> 05:29.640
<b>If you could please write the letter like so:</b>

05:30.810 --> 05:35.940
<b>"Thank you for being born our son."</b>

05:39.020 --> 05:39.560
<b>Of course.</b>

05:41.570 --> 05:42.650
<b>Air Show season, huh?</b>

05:43.230 --> 05:45.650
<b>It had been suspended during the war,</b>

05:46.240 --> 05:49.820
<b>so everyone's excited for its comeback after five years.</b>

05:51.490 --> 05:55.080
<b>The deadline for letter submissions is tomorrow,
so let's keep at it for one more day.</b>

05:56.330 --> 05:58.040
<b>Yes, I'll do my best.</b>

06:02.340 --> 06:05.800
<b>I'm thinking of writing a letter myself.</b>

06:06.670 --> 06:10.430
<b>I used to be a showgirl before I became a Doll.</b>

06:10.430 --> 06:12.810
<b>Many of our patrons were soldiers,</b>

06:14.270 --> 06:16.600
<b>and many of them are dead now.</b>

06:18.640 --> 06:21.190
<b>I'm thinking of writing to them.</b>

06:23.900 --> 06:25.690
<b>Why don't you write one too?</b>

06:27.820 --> 06:32.330
<b>I've never written a letter of my own.</b>

06:32.740 --> 06:36.000
<b>Then this can be a memorable first.</b>

06:38.040 --> 06:41.790
<b>Just write how you feel right now—</b>

06:41.790 --> 06:43.630
<b>as your heart wills you.</b>

06:45.460 --> 06:46.510
<b>As my heart...</b>

06:51.720 --> 06:52.470
<b>Major.</b>

06:53.680 --> 06:54.470
<b>What is it?</b>

06:55.260 --> 06:57.220
<b>Am I not needed anymore?</b>

06:58.100 --> 06:59.480
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

07:00.020 --> 07:04.480
<b>Will I be disposed of and transferred into Colonel Hodgins's custody?</b>

07:06.190 --> 07:09.950
<b>Will you not give me orders anymore?</b>

07:12.070 --> 07:15.660
<b>Do you want my orders so badly?</b>

07:16.200 --> 07:17.620
<b>Your orders are everything to me.</b>

07:20.250 --> 07:24.130
<b>After this battle, you can stop taking orders from me.</b>

07:25.090 --> 07:28.300
<b>Actually, you can stop taking orders from anyone.</b>

07:28.960 --> 07:30.130
<b>Live free.</b>

07:31.130 --> 07:34.050
<b>Is that an order?</b>

07:35.850 --> 07:36.810
<b>Why?</b>

07:37.720 --> 07:39.310
<b>Why would you take that as an order?</b>

07:40.480 --> 07:45.060
<b>Do you really think I see you as a tool?</b>

07:46.190 --> 07:50.280
<b>If I did, I would never have carried you out of there and taken you back home.</b>

07:51.610 --> 07:54.700
<b>I would never have kept you beside me all this while!</b>

07:54.950 --> 07:59.950
<b>You should know that I'm only feeling this anger and anguish because I want what's best for you!</b>

08:03.040 --> 08:04.210
<b>Major?</b>

08:05.130 --> 08:06.920
<b>You have emotions.</b>

08:07.880 --> 08:09.760
<b>You have a heart, just like me!</b>

08:10.760 --> 08:12.130
<b>If you don't...</b>

08:12.630 --> 08:15.140
<b>If you don't, then how do you explain that look on your face?!</b>

08:15.510 --> 08:17.510
<b>You're perfectly capable of making such expressions!</b>

08:18.140 --> 08:20.020
<b>You find me scary right now, don't you?</b>

08:20.430 --> 08:23.140
<b>You don't like being yelled at out of nowhere, do you?</b>

08:23.140 --> 08:24.020
<b>I don't understand.</b>

08:24.600 --> 08:27.310
<b>These unreasonable words anger you, don't they?</b>

08:27.310 --> 08:28.190
<b>I don't understand.</b>

08:28.610 --> 08:29.360
<b>You lie!</b>

08:31.280 --> 08:32.650
<b>I'm not lying.</b>

08:34.410 --> 08:36.870
<b>I really don't understand.</b>

08:38.330 --> 08:39.120
<b>I...</b>

08:40.240 --> 08:42.870
<b>I want to keep taking orders from you.</b>

08:43.910 --> 08:47.630
<b>If you order me to, I shall go anywhere.</b>

08:49.170 --> 08:50.960
<b>That's all.</b>

08:57.640 --> 08:58.890
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:59.720 --> 09:06.850
<b>But I can't watch you force yourself to remain a tool.</b>

09:06.850 --> 09:08.400
<b>It hurts me.</b>

09:08.400 --> 09:14.990
<b>I was the one who took you in when you were so young and turned you into this.</b>

09:15.860 --> 09:16.490
<b>And yet,</b>

09:18.200 --> 09:20.740
<b>you still believe in me...</b>

09:31.460 --> 09:33.260
<b>You haven't done anything wrong.</b>

09:36.220 --> 09:38.260
<b>The final battle is only a few hours away.</b>

09:38.760 --> 09:41.760
<b>Let's talk about this some other time.</b>

09:51.440 --> 09:52.610
<b>You couldn't write one?</b>

09:54.900 --> 09:57.110
<b>I do have emotions I want to express,</b>

09:57.860 --> 10:00.370
<b>and I had them back then too.</b>

10:00.990 --> 10:03.870
<b>But I don't know what I...</b>

10:04.790 --> 10:08.290
<b>...want to tell the major?</b>

10:08.290 --> 10:09.330
<b>Violet.</b>

10:11.710 --> 10:13.960
<b>The deadline is tonight,</b>

10:13.960 --> 10:17.420
<b>but if you can write a letter by the morning,
I'll take it to the admins for you.</b>

10:18.180 --> 10:19.680
<b>So try to write something.</b>

10:20.340 --> 10:21.300
<b>Even if it's short—</b>

10:22.050 --> 10:23.560
<b>even if it's only one sentence.</b>

10:27.980 --> 10:28.600
<b>Come in.</b>

10:29.690 --> 10:31.310
<b>Excuse me.</b>

10:31.770 --> 10:33.980
<b>Someone's here to see Violet.</b>

10:34.530 --> 10:37.240
<b>A man named Bougainvillea.</b>

10:39.860 --> 10:41.450
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

10:47.660 --> 10:48.290
<b>Over here.</b>

10:58.130 --> 11:02.260
<b>You must've been busy ghostwriting letters for the Air Show until yesterday.</b>

11:03.350 --> 11:06.770
<b>I'm sorry you had to meet me on your day off.</b>

11:07.270 --> 11:07.890
<b>It's fine.</b>

11:08.480 --> 11:11.770
<b>You've never been to our Leiden mansion before, have you?</b>

11:13.020 --> 11:14.770
<b>I should warn you in advance.</b>

11:15.730 --> 11:18.150
<b>Their memory has gotten a bit hazy.</b>

11:27.620 --> 11:28.450
<b>It's our mother.</b>

11:32.580 --> 11:33.790
<b>You are?</b>

11:35.920 --> 11:37.250
<b>This is Violet.</b>

11:38.590 --> 11:40.300
<b>You said you wanted to meet her.</b>

11:41.090 --> 11:46.310
<b>Oh, right. The one he wants us to adopt.</b>

11:47.720 --> 11:49.640
<b>You're finally here.</b>

11:51.020 --> 11:51.560
<b>Yes.</b>

11:52.900 --> 11:54.860
<b>Isn't Gilbert with you?</b>

11:55.690 --> 11:58.280
<b>Mother, Gilbert is...</b>

12:02.490 --> 12:03.410
<b>He is with us.</b>

12:10.120 --> 12:12.710
<b>It's the same color as his eyes.</b>

12:15.330 --> 12:18.340
<b>It's the same color as your eyes.</b>

12:21.550 --> 12:23.340
<b>Beautiful, isn't it?</b>

12:24.970 --> 12:25.640
<b>Yes.</b>

12:26.300 --> 12:30.100
<b>I didn't know the word, so I never said it.</b>

12:30.770 --> 12:35.150
<b>But I've always thought your eyes were beautiful from the first time we met.</b>

12:38.070 --> 12:39.690
<b>Very beautiful.</b>

12:41.740 --> 12:46.280
<b>So, what is your relationship with Gilbert?</b>

12:46.280 --> 12:49.240
<b>The major took me in,</b>

12:50.200 --> 12:51.450
<b>raised me,</b>

12:52.160 --> 12:54.120
<b>and gave me a purpose.</b>

12:54.830 --> 12:55.500
<b>But...</b>

12:59.420 --> 13:04.260
<b>I know. In the battle of Intens, he...</b>

13:05.590 --> 13:09.890
<b>That's right. You asked to see her to discuss that.</b>

13:10.260 --> 13:11.180
<b>Right, Mother?</b>

13:12.810 --> 13:14.060
<b>Right.</b>

13:23.530 --> 13:25.900
<b>It wasn't your fault.</b>

13:27.870 --> 13:30.370
<b>It isn't your cross to bear.</b>

13:31.910 --> 13:36.870
<b>Dietfried keeps telling me to give up on Gilbert...</b>

13:38.130 --> 13:41.750
<b>when I know he can't give up on him either.</b>

13:42.920 --> 13:48.390
<b>The two of them were always such loving brothers.</b>

13:51.890 --> 13:54.520
<b>He's alive...</b>

13:58.270 --> 13:59.610
<b>within my heart.</b>

14:02.690 --> 14:04.860
<b>So I won't ever forget him.</b>

14:06.240 --> 14:10.410
<b>Even if it always hurts to remember,
I'll live the rest of my life thinking about him.</b>

14:12.200 --> 14:13.370
<b>I mean, even now,</b>

14:17.080 --> 14:18.830
<b>I still love him.</b>

14:22.210 --> 14:22.800
<b>Right.</b>

14:27.010 --> 14:27.760
<b>Right.</b>

14:31.970 --> 14:32.550
<b>Right.</b>

14:47.610 --> 14:48.490
<b>Violet.</b>

14:50.910 --> 14:53.620
<b>Live his share of life too.</b>

14:54.410 --> 14:57.200
<b>Live, live, live some more,</b>

15:00.080 --> 15:01.420
<b>and die.</b>

15:03.210 --> 15:06.760
<b>Those are my final orders for you.</b>

15:09.420 --> 15:09.930
<b>I...</b>

15:12.850 --> 15:14.510
<b>I don't need orders anymore.</b>

15:26.320 --> 15:31.280
<b><i>Gilbert never treated the tool I cast away as one.</i></b>

15:32.240 --> 15:38.330
<b><i>So, even though she lost her arms and her master,</i></b>

15:39.500 --> 15:46.590
<b><i>she will never lose all the important things he gave her.</i></b>

16:25.500 --> 16:28.460
<b>I'm really glad the weather cleared up in time.</b>

16:28.960 --> 16:31.840
<b>Yeah. It actually snowed, and Leiden never gets snow.</b>

16:32.550 --> 16:33.760
<b>Violet!</b>

16:35.010 --> 16:36.350
<b>Luculia.</b>

16:36.350 --> 16:38.890
<b>I'm glad you could make it.</b>

16:38.890 --> 16:42.680
<b>It must've been hectic with all the ghostwriting for the Air Show.</b>

16:43.940 --> 16:48.190
<b>Not really, but I did write a lot of letters.</b>

16:49.150 --> 16:52.440
<b>I even wrote one of my own for the first time.</b>

16:55.160 --> 16:56.160
<b>I see.</b>

16:56.870 --> 16:59.660
<b>I wrote one to my parents too.</b>

17:02.200 --> 17:04.330
<b>I'm sure it'll reach them.</b>

17:06.000 --> 17:07.130
<b>Thanks.</b>

17:07.130 --> 17:08.920
<b>I wrote one too!</b>

17:09.250 --> 17:10.750
<b>To my future self,</b>

17:10.750 --> 17:15.680
<b>who has become Leiden's— no, the continent's most popular Doll!</b>

17:15.680 --> 17:17.510
<b>That's one lofty goal.</b>

17:17.510 --> 17:18.760
<b>What about you, Erica?</b>

17:19.390 --> 17:20.890
<b>What did you write?</b>

17:23.850 --> 17:27.730
<b>I've fallen for someone recently, so I wrote a love—</b>

17:27.730 --> 17:29.150
<b>What?</b>

17:29.150 --> 17:31.480
<b>Who? Who is it?!</b>

17:31.480 --> 17:32.320
<b>Hey!</b>

17:33.940 --> 17:36.610
<b>Want to know what I wrote?</b>

17:36.610 --> 17:37.740
<b>Yes. I do.</b>

17:38.200 --> 17:39.410
<b>Ah.</b>

17:39.410 --> 17:40.240
<b>Believe it or not,</b>

17:40.700 --> 17:42.410
<b>I wrote it to Hodgins.</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:44.540
<b>"One day,</b>

17:45.460 --> 17:47.250
<b>I'm going to be the boss."</b>

17:47.500 --> 17:49.380
<b>Wait, you want to take my place?</b>

17:49.710 --> 17:51.800
<b>What kind of letter is that?!</b>

17:51.800 --> 17:53.960
<b>You're one to talk.</b>

17:53.960 --> 17:55.800
<b>What kind of letter is <i>this</i>?</b>

17:57.340 --> 17:59.010
<b>"From Papa, to my future daughter."</b>

17:59.010 --> 18:00.390
<b>How'd you get that?</b>

18:00.970 --> 18:01.970
<b>Stop!</b>

18:02.640 --> 18:07.440
<b>I found a bunch of drafts crammed into the trash can in your office,</b>

18:07.440 --> 18:08.400
<b>Papa.</b>

18:08.400 --> 18:10.230
<b>You of all people shouldn't be calling me that!</b>

18:10.230 --> 18:12.440
<b>Papa...</b>

18:12.690 --> 18:15.240
<b>Stop it!</b>

18:15.240 --> 18:18.070
<b>"Papa's eagerly awaiting the day you are born.</b>

18:21.240 --> 18:25.950
<b>And I'm praying that you grow up healthy and strong,</b>

18:26.620 --> 18:28.710
<b>that you find happiness,</b>

18:29.420 --> 18:33.050
<b>and that you love someone who loves you just as much.</b>

18:33.840 --> 18:38.380
<b>And I pray that the future you and your children live in</b>

18:39.130 --> 18:44.640
<b>is a world free of conflict and filled with happiness."</b>

18:59.150 --> 19:03.450
<b><i>The feelings of countless
people are raining from the sky.</i></b>

19:05.790 --> 19:06.830
<b><i>Violet.</i></b>

19:12.830 --> 19:13.840
<b><i>Major...</i></b>

19:17.260 --> 19:20.130
<b><i>"Dear Major Gilbert,</i></b>

19:22.050 --> 19:23.430
<b><i>Do you have any news?</i></b>

19:24.480 --> 19:26.060
<b><i>Are you doing well?</i></b>

19:26.640 --> 19:29.270
<b><i>Where are you right now?</i></b>

19:30.440 --> 19:32.350
<b><i>Are you having any difficulties?</i></b>

19:36.400 --> 19:41.700
<b><i>Spring, summer, autumn, and winter...</i></b>

19:42.990 --> 19:45.240
<b><i>Many seasons have come and gone,</i></b>

19:45.830 --> 19:49.910
<b><i>but the one with you isn't coming around at all.</i></b>

19:51.790 --> 19:55.000
<b><i>At first, I couldn't understand.</i></b>

19:56.090 --> 19:59.880
<b><i>I couldn't understand anything about how you felt.</i></b>

20:01.050 --> 20:06.720
<b><i>But within this new life you gave me,</i></b>

20:06.720 --> 20:11.730
<b><i>I've begun to feel the same way as you, if only a little,</i></b>

20:13.770 --> 20:18.320
<b><i>through ghostwriting, and through the people I've met along the way.</i></b>

20:23.570 --> 20:25.710
<b><i>I believe that...</i></b>

20:27.750 --> 20:30.950
<b><i>you are still alive somewhere.</i></b>

20:32.620 --> 20:38.210
<b><i>So I shall live, live, live,</i></b>

20:39.380 --> 20:44.380
<b><i>and live some more, though there's no telling what life might have in store.</i></b>

20:47.600 --> 20:52.480
<b><i>And if I can ever see you again, I want to let you know...</i></b>

20:53.810 --> 20:58.020
<b><i>that the phrase "I love you"...</i></b>

21:07.370 --> 21:09.200
<b>I understand it a little now.</b>

22:28.240 --> 22:31.910
<b>Ghostwriting request, Violet! They say it's urgent!</b>

22:32.910 --> 22:35.200
<b>Benedict, you make some tea.</b>

22:35.200 --> 22:37.660
<b>What? Why should I?</b>

22:42.290 --> 22:45.420
<b>Violet, the customer's waiting.</b>

22:50.090 --> 22:52.760
<b>I'll be right there.</b>

22:53.560 --> 23:03.570
Auto Memoir Doll and "I Love You"

23:20.540 --> 23:22.290
<b>It is a pleasure to meet you.</b>

23:23.100 --> 23:26.300
<b>If a client requests it, we shall go anywhere.</b>

23:27.670 --> 23:29.550
<b>Representing the Auto Memoir Doll service,</b>

23:34.540 --> 23:36.490
<b>I am Violet Evergarden.</b>
